{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43483","headline":"膏泽多丰年 · 无名氏","name":"膏泽多丰年","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝德方多泽，莓莓井径同。\n八方甘雨布，四远报年丰。\n厫庆千厢在，山流万壑通。\n候时勤稼穑，击壤乐农功。\n畎亩人无惰，田庐岁不空。\n何须忧伏腊，千载贺尧风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43483.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43483","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}